e lavabo\" lui répondit..."},{"auteur":"Horohoro","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1929.jpg","date_sans_annee":"30/08 14:35","score":0,"id":144468,"texte":"... des portes..."},{"auteur":"Ash","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/115.jpg","date_sans_annee":"30/08 14:37","score":0,"id":144471,"texte":"....en laine de mouton 100% coton...."},{"auteur":"Horohoro","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1929.jpg","date_sans_annee":"30/08 14:38","score":0,"id":144474,"texte":"... peinte en vert..."},{"auteur":"Roberto","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/2261.jpg","date_sans_annee":"30/08 14:43","score":0,"id":144481,"texte":"\"Hum...Mais pourquoi m'avoir attaquer ?\"demanda-t'il."},{"auteur":"Horohoro","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1929.jpg","date_sans_annee":"30/08 14:44","score":0,"id":144482,"texte":"\"Parce que les chiens..."},{"auteur":"Roi Liche","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1222.gif","date_sans_annee":"30/08 14:47","score":0,"id":144487,"texte":"était grillé...."},{"auteur":"Horohoro","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1929.jpg","date_sans_annee":"30/08 14:50","score":0,"id":144494,"texte":"... sur le barbecue..."},{"auteur":"Angus Young","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/925.gif","date_sans_annee":"30/08 14:54","score":0,"id":144502,"texte":"...et il ne reatit plus une seule boite de haricots verts.\n\nAlors, le gobelin commencea à se préparer..."},{"auteur":"Horohoro","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1929.jpg","date_sans_annee":"30/08 15:00","score":0,"id":144513,"texte":"...à lacher une caisse..."},{"auteur":"Anaek","avatar":"archivesbeta